"""
Python Journey - Desktop Edition
Learn Python. Pass quizzes. Win badges.

A CustomTkinter desktop version of the original console program. Every
lesson, quiz question, scoring rule, rank, and certificate text from the
original code are preserved.

NEW in this version
  * Real PDF certificate (landscape A4) drawn with ReportLab
  * "Save as PDF" with a Save As dialog
  * Gmail delivery with the PDF attached
      - Gmail API + OAuth 2.0 (default, no password needed), or
      - the original Google App Password (SMTP) login, still supported
  * Delivery status chips: PDF Generated / PDF Saved / Email Sent

NEW in the Accounts edition
  * User accounts (sign in / create account) stored in SQLite, with
    PBKDF2-SHA256 salted password hashing (no plain-text passwords)
  * Automatic saving: opening a lesson, every quiz attempt, passing a lesson,
    badges, ranks, certificate eligibility and delivery are saved instantly
  * Lesson status indicators: Not Started (gray), In Progress (blue), Completed (green)
    and an overall progress bar
  * Profile page (picture, name, @username, bio, stats, achievements, activity)
  * Edit Profile, circular profile pictures (PNG/JPG/JPEG) with preview
  * Account Settings: personal info, picture, password, logout, delete account

Run:      python python_journey.py
Requires: pip install customtkinter pillow reportlab
Data:     ~/.python_journey/python_journey.db  and  ~/.python_journey/avatars/
          (set the PYTHON_JOURNEY_HOME environment variable to use another folder)
"""

